# ── secrets: never committable, no exceptions ──────────────────────────
# (v2 lesson: API keys leaked via a .bat helper script and live in git
#  history forever. Block every common secret carrier preemptively.)
.env*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.bat
*.secret
credentials*.json
serviceAccount*.json
